 "code": "def can_jump(nums: list[int]) -> bool:\n    reach = 0\n    last = len(nums) - 1\n    for i, step in enumerate(nums):\n        if i > reach:\n            return False          # a gap: index i is unreachable\n        reach = max(reach, i + step)\n        if reach >= last:\n            return True\n    return True\n",
